  "contract": {
    "run_rank": "Unsigned low byte of retained ready entry heroic, default zero, capped at five. Effective game admission supplies ready. Existing entry survives a nonnull restart and is reset on logout.",
    "menu_rank": "Picker heroic byte bounded by the class/zone account ceiling and five. The native missing-account branch gives zero.",
    "zone_label": "Localized zone followed by a space, opening parenthesis, localized Normal or localized Heroic plus a space and Roman I through V, then closing parenthesis.",
    "consumers": "Picker Next stop, the run phase templates that substitute bg, and run large_text with its existing subtitle. Boss, choice and endless state text use their own arguments.",
    "lobby_gate": "Nonempty role, status hosting/joining/joined/left and nonempty admitted service code.",
    "party_payload": "Present in picker and run activities. id is azs- followed by unpadded lowercase hexadecimal FNV-1a-64 of the code bytes. size is [max(1, roster count), 5].",
    "friend_text": "Preserve received roster order, omit rows whose me marker equals 1, and join other names with comma-space. When nonempty, prepend localized Co-op with {friends} and a space-middle-dot-space to run large_text."
